id=uicc_apps_enabled
name=Unknown UICC apps state counts as enabled
version=v1
versionCode=1
author=MinsOS
description=With an SK Telecom SIM inserted after a boot without SIM, calls and SMS worked but mobile data never connected: GsmCdmaPhone.isUiccApplicationsEnabled() read a never-learned state (null, the A13 RIL answered SIM_ABSENT at boot and is not asked again) as disabled, so isSubscriptionEnabled() stayed false and PhoneSwitcher on a KOR build never chose a data phone. Unknown now counts as enabled; an explicit false from the RIL still disables.
